    "title_english": "差 — assistance, difference, assignment, and recovery",
    "summary_english": "A phonetic compound formed by adding the phonetic 󵡮 to 𠂇 or 左. Its original sense is assistance, read zuǒ, and it developed deputy status, difference, error, selection and assignment, rank, and recovery from illness under later readings.",
