    "unicode": "U+6E38",
    "title_english": "游 — a banner pendant, swimming, and wandering",
    "summary_english": "A phono-semantic character whose oracle-bone form is 斿, a child beneath a banner and an emblem of supervision. Later additions of 彳, 辵, and 水 produced forms connected with flag pendants, swimming, travel, office, and free movement.",
    "etymology": {
      "available": true,
      "headword": "游",
      "entry_form": "游",
      "related_headwords": [],
      "pronunciation": "yóu喻纽、幽部；以纽、尤韵、以周切。\nliú来纽、幽部；来纽、尤韵、力求切。\nxjū邪纽、幽部；邪纽、尤韵、徐由切。",
      "bibliography": [
        "《金文编》463页",
        "《甲文编》289页",
        "《汉语字形表》263页",
        "《睡甲》105页",
        "《金文编》464页",
        "《楚系简帛》573页",
        "《说文》140页",
        "《篆隶表》456页"
      ],
      "explanation_original": "形声字。甲骨文作“斿”，从㫃，从子，不从水。字形像一子立于旌旗下之形，表示“督导”之义。此字当即“纛”或“翿”，也即汉代人所说的华盖。“纛”为定纽﹑幽部字，“督”为端纽﹑觉部字，而“游”字为余纽\n（喻四）\n﹑幽部字；“喻四归定”，“幽”﹑“觉”阴入对转，所以它们的读音是很相近的。\n甲骨文中用为地名：“羌其陷麋于斿。”\n（《合集》5579正）\n金文或加“彳”旁，战国文字则加“辵”旁，即“遊”字。或加“水”旁，小篆中的“游”就是由此演变而来的。\n《说文》：“游，旌旗之流也。从㫃，汓声。”\n“󴿬，古文游。”“流”即“旒”字，指旌旗下垂的摆穗，也称“赘旒”。《说文》对于字形\n（“从㫃，汓声”）\n﹑字义\n（“旌旗之流”）\n的分析，从古文字来看都是有问题的。\n《左传·桓公二年》：“鞶厉游缨。”\n杜预注：“游，旌旗之游也。”\n就是用的《说文》的本义。也作“斿”。\n《周礼·春官·巾车》：“建大常，十有二斿。”\n郑玄注：“正幅为縿，斿则属焉。”\n这实际上也是“旒”字的假借，指连缀在旗帜边幅上的摆穗。\n《方言》卷十：“潜，又游也。”\n则是“浮游”﹑“漂游”﹑“游泳”之“游”，这实际上是《说文》训为“浮行水上也”的“汓”字，也即是“泅”。又用为“游行”﹑“出游”﹑“旅游”﹑“遨游”﹑“交游”之“游”，又引申为“出仕”﹑“高飞”﹑“自如”等义。又假借为“流”﹑“蝣”﹑“囮”等等。\n（王志平）",
      "images_omitted": true,
      "requested_character": "遊",
      "redirects": [
        {
          "from": "遊",
          "to": "游",
          "kind": "see-also"
        }
      ],
      "explanation_english": [
        "游 is a phono-semantic character. Oracle-bone writing has 斿, with 㫃 and 子 and no 水. It depicts a child standing beneath a banner, expressing supervision. This graph is probably 纛 or 翿, the ceremonial banner called 华盖 in Han sources. 纛 belongs to the Ding initial and You rhyme group, 督 to the Duan initial and Jue group, and 游 to the Yu initial（喻四） and You group; because 喻四归定 and 幽 and 觉 are paired yin-entering rhymes, their readings are close. Oracle-bone texts use it as a place name: “羌其陷麋于斿。” （《合集》5579正）",
        "Bronze writing may add 彳, while Warring-States writing adds 辵 to produce 遊. Other forms add 水; small-seal 游 develops from these. 《说文》 says “游，旌旗之流也。从㫃，汓声。” “󴿬，古文游。” Here 流 is 旒, the pendant tassels hanging below a banner, also called 赘旒. The analysis “从㫃，汓声” and the meaning ‘banner pendants’ do not accord with the earlier forms. 《左传·桓公二年》 says “鞶厉游缨。” Du Yu comments “游，旌旗之游也。” This uses the 《说文》 sense. The graph also appears as 斿. 《周礼·春官·巾车》 says “建大常，十有二斿。” Zheng Xuan explains “正幅为縿，斿则属焉。” This is likewise a loan for 旒, the tassels attached to the edge of a banner.",
        "《方言》卷十 says “潜，又游也。” This 游, found in 浮游, 漂游, and 游泳, is in fact the character 汓, which 《说文》 glosses “浮行水上也”, namely 泅. 游 is also used in 游行, 出游, 旅游, 遨游, and 交游; it developed senses of entering official service, flying high, and moving at ease. It is additionally borrowed for 流, 蝣, 囮, and other characters. (Wang Zhiping)"
      ]
    },
