    "character": "戒",
    "aliases": [],
    "unicode": "U+6212",
    "title_english": "戒: hands holding a weapon in vigilance",
    "summary_english": "戒 is an associative character showing two hands holding a 戈. It directly expresses vigilance and remains the basis of words such as 警戒 and 戒备.",
    "etymology": {
      "available": true,
      "headword": "戒",
      "pronunciation": "jiè见纽、职部；见纽、怪韵、古拜切。",
      "bibliography": [
        "《甲文编》101页",
        "《金文编》160页",
        "《汉语字形表》101页",
        "《说文》59页",
        "《睡甲》37页",
        "《篆隶表》179页"
      ],
      "explanation_original": "会意字。以双手持戈会警戒意。\n《说文》：“戒，警也。从廾持戈，以戒不虞。”\n论形说义，都很精当。现代汉语“警戒”﹑“戒备”中的“戒”，用的还是本义。\n（李守奎）",
      "images_omitted": true,
      "explanation_english": [
        "戒 is an associative character. It combines two hands holding a 戈 to express alertness and vigilance. 《说文》 says “戒，警也。从廾持戈，以戒不虞。” Both its graphic analysis and explanation are exact. Modern uses such as 警戒 and 戒备 retain the original meaning."
      ]
    },
