    "character": "仰",
    "aliases": [],
    "unicode": "U+4EF0",
    "title_english": "仰 — raising the head and looking upward",
    "summary_english": "An associative character from 人 and 卬. 仰 directly means lifting one’s head or looking upward.",
    "etymology": {
      "available": true,
      "headword": "仰",
      "pronunciation": "yǎng疑纽、阳部；疑纽、养韵、鱼两切。",
      "bibliography": [
        "《说文》164页",
        "《甲金篆》549页"
      ],
      "explanation_original": "会意字。从人，从卬。卬，表示仰望之意。本义是抬头。\n《说文》：“仰，举也。”\n（董莲池）",
      "images_omitted": true,
      "explanation_english": [
        "An associative character from 人 and 卬, where 卬 conveys the act of looking upward. Its original meaning is to raise the head. 《说文》：“仰，举也。” （董莲池）"
      ]
    },
