    "title_english": "支 — bamboo branch, limb, support, and phonetic loans",
    "summary_english": "An associative character of a hand holding half a bamboo stalk. 支 originally meant a branch separated from bamboo, then extended to plant stems, limbs, support, measure-word use, surnames, and several loan readings.",
