    "character": "佛",
    "aliases": [],
    "unicode": "U+4F5B",
    "title_english": "佛 — seeing indistinctly",
    "summary_english": "A phonetic compound from 人 and 弗. Its original meaning is to see something unclearly.",
    "etymology": {
      "available": true,
      "headword": "佛",
      "pronunciation": "fú並纽、物部；奉纽、物韵、符弗切。",
      "bibliography": [
        "《说文》163页"
      ],
      "explanation_original": "形声字。从人，弗声。本义指看不清楚。\n《说文》：“佛，见不审也。”\n（董莲池）",
      "images_omitted": true,
      "explanation_english": [
        "A phonetic compound from 人 with 弗 as phonetic. 《说文》：“佛，见不审也。” Its original meaning is seeing without clear discernment. （董莲池）"
      ]
    },
