    "unicode": "U+6EFF",
    "title_english": "滿 — full and overflowing",
    "summary_english": "A phonetic compound from 水 with 㒼 as phonetic. 滿 means filled to capacity and develops satisfaction, fullness, abundance, and completeness.",
    "etymology": {
      "available": true,
      "headword": "滿",
      "entry_form": "滿",
      "related_headwords": [
        "满"
      ],
      "pronunciation": "",
      "bibliography": [
        "《战文编》743页",
        "《说文》231页",
        "《汉印徵》卷11，8页",
        "《篆隶表》796页"
      ],
      "explanation_original": "形声字。从水，㒼声。充盈。\n《说文》：“滿，盈溢也。”\n《广雅·释诂四》：“满，充也。”\n《庄子·天运》：“在谷满谷，在阬满阬。”\n引申有满足﹑饱满﹑充实﹑全等义。例不备举。滿所从声符“㒼”今简化“𬜯”，凡所从者，依例简化。\n（王逸鹤）",
      "images_omitted": true,
      "requested_character": "滿",
      "redirects": [],
      "explanation_english": [
        "A phonetic compound from 水 with 㒼 as phonetic. Its original sense is fullness or overflowing: 《说文》：“滿，盈溢也。” 《广雅·释诂四》：“满，充也。” 《庄子·天运》 says: “在谷满谷，在阬满阬。” It extends to satisfaction, plumpness, enrichment, and entirety. The phonetic 㒼 is simplified as 𬜯, and characters containing it follow that pattern. （王逸鹤）"
      ]
    },
