    "unicode": "U+8AA0",
    "title_english": "誠 — sincerity and trustworthiness",
    "summary_english": "A phonetic compound from 言 with 成 as phonetic. 誠 means truthfulness and sincerity, a core sense still current in modern Chinese.",
    "etymology": {
      "available": true,
      "headword": "誠",
      "entry_form": "誠",
      "related_headwords": [
        "诚"
      ],
      "pronunciation": "",
      "bibliography": [
        "《战文编》139页",
        "《说文》52页",
        "《汉印徵》卷3，5页",
        "《睡甲》32页",
        "《篆隶表》153页"
      ],
      "explanation_original": "形声字。从言，成声。\n《说文》：“誠，信也。”\n《易·乾》：“闲邪存其诚。”\n孔颖达疏：“言防闲邪恶，当自存其真实也。”\n“诚”的本义现在还常用，“诚信”﹑“诚实”﹑“诚心诚意”等词语中的“诚”皆是。\n（李守奎）",
      "images_omitted": true,
      "requested_character": "誠",
      "redirects": [],
      "explanation_english": [
        "A phonetic compound from 言 with 成 as phonetic. 《说文》：“誠，信也。” 《易·乾》 says: “闲邪存其诚。” Kong Yingda explains that one must guard against evil and preserve what is genuine. This is the same sense found in modern compounds such as 诚信, 诚实, and 诚心诚意. （李守奎）",
        "The basic sense of truthful sincerity is specified in: 「言防闲邪恶，当自存其真实也。」"
      ]
    },
