    "title_english": "葉 — leaf",
    "summary_english": "A phonetic compound from 艸 with 枼 as phonetic. 葉 first means the leaf of a plant and extends to leaf-like or light, floating things.",
    "etymology": {
      "available": true,
      "headword": "葉",
      "entry_form": "葉",
      "related_headwords": [
        "叶"
      ],
      "pronunciation": "",
      "bibliography": [
        "《战文编》31页",
        "《说文》22页",
        "《篆隶表》44页"
      ],
      "explanation_original": "形声字。从艸，枼声。本义是指植物的叶子。\n《说文》：“葉，草木之叶也。”\n《诗·小雅·苕之华》：“其叶青青。”\n引申之亦可指像叶子一样的东西。如：肺叶﹑百叶窗。亦可指轻飘的东西。如：一叶扁舟。\n（白于蓝）",
      "images_omitted": true,
      "requested_character": "葉",
      "redirects": [],
      "explanation_english": [
        "A phonetic compound from 艸 with 枼 as phonetic. Its original meaning is a plant leaf. 《说文》：“葉，草木之叶也。” 《诗·小雅·苕之华》 says: “其叶青青.” By extension it can refer to things shaped like leaves, such as 肺叶 and 百叶窗, and to light floating things, as in 一叶扁舟. （白于蓝）",
        "The plant leaf and its shaped or floating extensions are illustrated by: 「其叶青青。」"
      ]
    },
